Summary of Significant Modifications in pan-tools:
- Modularized CLI/REPL entry point (`internal/cliapp`), decoupled terminal UI layer (`internal/ui`), and added a fullscreen Bubble Tea file explorer (`internal/tui`).
- Added standalone terminal QR code login (`internal/pcscommand/qrlogin.go`) and interactive login method selection (`pant login` / `pant login -qr`).
- Removed external GPL-3.0 dependencies (`Baidu-Login` and `baidu-tools`), replacing AES/GZIP/Base64 helpers with pure Go standard library implementations (`pcsutil/crypto.go`, `baidupcs/internal/panhome/sign.go`) and switching user info / UK lookup to HTTPS Baidu Netdisk APIs.
- Rebranded the CLI binary, runtime configuration directory (`~/.config/pan-tools`), environment variables (`PANT_*`), and documentation to `pan-tools` (`pant`).
